17 UDN: 828 to 844

00:27:57.666 --> 00:28:01.666
Introduction of Study 102 Male Mice into
Halsey Marsden’s Study 12, CA 65
 Minutes]

00:28:01.666 --> 00:28:06.599
[60* Color 1970 Jan. 27; UDN: 828 12
 Aggressive Males from Study 102

00:28:06.600 --> 00:28:09.400
into Univ. 12, Study 122 CA 15 Minutes]

00:28:09.400 --> 00:28:37.166
[Mice are released from a box onto the 
center of the floor. They scramble around
 the area.]

00:28:37.166 --> 00:28:52.366
[One mouse sits in the center of the 
universe while others sniff around him.]

00:28:52.366 --> 00:29:01.299
[Mice are fighting one another, scratching and rolling about.]

00:29:01.300 --> 00:29:17.466
[A white mouse marked with red continues 
to be aggressive with each mouse he comes near.]

00:29:17.466 --> 00:29:29.966
[Camera zooms out, showing mice 
scampering about the universe, seeming 
to pursue each other.]

00:29:29.966 --> 00:29:44.466
[Some of the non-aggressive mice have
 retreated to corners and secluded areas of the 
universe.]

00:29:44.466 --> 00:30:00.266
[One black mouse is pursuing and fighting with others.]

00:30:00.266 --> 00:30:11.766
[A white mouse with red marking is sitting
 on top of a shelf where he is out of reach 
of the others.]

00:30:11.766 --> 00:30:28.899
[Most mice have retreated from the center
of the universe and are avoiding each other.]

00:30:28.900 --> 00:30:46.200
[Two mice are seen fighting, chasing one another. They scuffle in a corner and continue to engage aggressively.]

00:30:46.200 --> 00:31:01.866
[A white mouse crouching alone in an elevated area 
remains there while the others fight on the floor beneath him.]

00:31:01.866 --> 00:31:19.466
[One of the secluded mice leaves his 
elevated perch and makes his way around the universe.]

00:31:19.466 --> 00:31:32.932
[No other mice seem to be present.]

00:31:32.933 --> 00:31:32.999
[No other mice seem to be present.]

00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:38.366
[He returns to his dwelling.]

00:31:38.366 --> 00:31:41.999
[63* Color 1970 Jan. 29; UDN: 830
12 Solitary Withdrawn Males from Study 102

00:31:42.000 --> 00:31:47.866
into Univ. 13, Study 122 CA Minutes]

00:31:47.866 --> 00:32:15.566
[Mice are dropped into the center of 
another universe. They spread out and make little contact with one another.]

00:32:15.566 --> 00:32:15.666
[Mice are dropped off into the center of
 another universe. They spread out and make little contact with one another.]

00:32:15.666 --> 00:32:32.366
[Some mice begin to engage with one another, showing aggression, while others remain apart.]

00:32:32.366 --> 00:32:58.166
[One black mouse begins to initiate aggressive contact with others he encounters.]

00:32:58.166 --> 00:33:23.232
[The aggressive behavior appears to spread through the population.]

00:33:23.233 --> 00:33:35.566
[Some mice appear to seek refuge as others continue to fight.]

00:33:35.566 --> 00:33:35.699
[Some mice appear to seek refuge as others continue to fight.]

00:33:35.700 --> 00:34:04.600
[Most contact is aggressive at this 
point.]

00:34:04.600 --> 00:34:08.600
[Time=0924]

00:34:08.600 --> 00:34:42.900
[Fighting continues.]

00:34:42.900 --> 00:35:07.033
[Some mice have remained apart from the others.]

00:35:07.033 --> 00:35:19.366
[One mouse chases another who doesn’t 
seem to want to come in contact with him.]

00:35:19.366 --> 00:35:25.632
[The universe calms.]

00:35:25.633 --> 00:35:44.399
[One mouse sits in his habitat eating, then peering over the side of his elevated retreat.]

00:35:44.400 --> 00:35:55.266
[A pair of mice continue to fight with each other.]

00:35:55.266 --> 00:36:07.466
[Roll 12 Univ. 13 0963]

00:36:07.466 --> 00:36:23.366
[Only two mice remain in sight.]

00:36:23.366 --> 00:36:26.866
[End Scene 0963]

00:36:26.866 --> 00:36:37.699
[Time 0679]

00:36:37.700 --> 00:37:10.600
[One mouse roams the universe alone.]

00:37:10.600 --> 00:38:03.666
[A lab worker replaces the water container 
on the side of the mouse universe.]

00:38:03.666 --> 00:38:15.466
[A second water container is added for the
 mice.]

00:38:15.466 --> 00:38:28.499
[The lab worker makes sure the water is coming out of the container properly.]

